    {
      "name": "CreateLimitOrderParams",
      "docs": [
        "Immutable owner-signed terms; identities come from instruction accounts. Token amounts are positive raw units. fill_allowance_lamports is prepaid by the payer, held by the order account, paid to the fill payer and refunded to rent_refund on cancel; zero means the owner funds their own fill. No order expiry."
      ],
