          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "LimitOrder",
      "docs": [
        "V1 is 251 bytes including discriminator PROPORD1. Offsets: version=8, status=9, config=10, owner=42, order_id=74, base_mint=106, quote_mint=138, side=170, input_amount=171, min_output_amount=179, created_at=187, rent_refund=195, fill_allowance_lamports=227, closed_at=235, output_amount=243. created_at and closed_at are Unix seconds from the chain clock. Terms are immutable; status, closed_at and output_amount (the fill's actual payout, 0 on cancel) are set once by the terminal transition. Terminal accounts are retained as order history; the initial payer receives reclaimed escrow rent."
      ],
